Package: datamesh
Type: Package
Title: Sovereign DataMesh Client SDK for Open Knowledge Format (OKF v0.2)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Datos", "Bolivia", email = "contacto@datosbolivia.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R binding for DataMesh Core SDK. Provides 1-line facade for sovereign
    federated open data catalogs, OKF / ODKF v0.2 data products, in-memory tabular streaming,
    and ANSI SQL querying via compiled Go Core C-ABI (libdatamesh) with pure R fallback.
